{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1001_p", "source_sha256": "11d83d0f09fd63e9ee2d2388ac8565da3660af57dfcff637affc5aca67ab9ad9", "ja": "お疲れさま、桃子。\nあれ、今日は休みだったろ。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。\n咦，你今天不是休息吗？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "eabb263fd8e05e05da101cd85a983c18394b8ec1aa5bfc977183f9e9c6c8ac73", "ja": "うん、ちょっとね。昨日のステージの感想、\nパソコンから見せてもらおうと思って。", "zh": "嗯，有点事。我想用电脑\n看看大家对昨天舞台的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1003_p", "source_sha256": "273c190e90f271e5235f785a1d59221f1b0273501b79642263da31d363f6a90b", "ja": "それでわざわざ来たのか？\nほら、ブログにもたくさんコメントが来てるぞ。", "zh": "所以你特意过来了？\n你看，博客上也有很多评论呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "cd6c9f59ca229bb75be942bf0901ccbc702002798d58532b89998bd711592bfd", "ja": "ありがと。\n……わ、ほんとだ。たくさん来てる。", "zh": "谢谢。\n……哇，真的耶。来了好多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "5d918c915296d67c24c9b38e2301de4f367a200d44c70255f10cdfb940c0044e", "ja": "「桃子ちゃんかわいかった」ありがとー。\n「新曲ステキだった」うん、桃子も大好き！", "zh": "“桃子好可爱”谢谢啦。\n“新歌很棒”嗯，桃子也最喜欢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "ead2f41a5786a78eaa92503a0bf217501b6696a9efd9ce4540b00bd5828576fb", "ja": "「夢を見てるみたいだった。私もアイドルになりたい」\n……えへへ、なんかうれしいな。なれるよ、きっと！", "zh": "“就像在做梦一样。我也想成为偶像”\n……嘿嘿，总觉得好开心啊。一定能当上的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c9dba070bf8cab7b9b80ed5cdd004e5120be1a8dc0c5ba23f1ddda14bc10304e", "ja": "いいステージだったな。\nお客さん達も、みんな笑顔だったよ。", "zh": "是一场很棒的演出呢。\n观众们也全都在笑着哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "a178639741b982ae30fab1ffbfe606a7e5831e1a9816497d8a0538f24ed0f389", "ja": "ふふん、当然でしょ♪\n夢を見せるのが、アイドルのお仕事なんだからね！", "zh": "哼哼，这不是当然的吗♪\n让大家看到梦想，就是偶像的工作呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1010_p", "source_sha256": "29c591570dfba6b0dd1db3b0b7943520647f0f6669aec52b72c915f6280579ee", "ja": "桃子？", "zh": "桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "c18712310747ed6948c0a75178feecd758ed125afaa91b6eddfaf4fd86737e20", "ja": "あ……ううん、なんでもない。\nせっかく来たから、桃子みんなのところに行ってくる。", "zh": "啊……没什么，什么都没有。\n难得来了，桃子去大家那边看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "3582580cbbfd85021d750650b7ab8da418c7d8a71376565dfd3f6e212f644ed1", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、お仕事ジャマしてごめんね。\n桃子が来たからって、サボったらダメだからね♪", "zh": "哥哥，对不起，打扰你工作了。\n就算桃子来了，也不能偷懒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a7049683cf4826acb17827c1930267e01f768d1d941b91f66ff73db0993405b7", "ja": "（これから先も、きっと……桃子が\n寂しさを感じなくなる事は、ないのだろう）", "zh": "（今后，桃子恐怕也一定……还是会感到寂寞吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_082_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c4f6b5ec1360c34f926e4e2d23a984ebf5508614242287422fefe4e8dfec7a32", "ja": "（それでも、できるだけ笑顔でいられるように。\n……俺にできる事は、きっとそれくらいだ）", "zh": "即便如此，为了让她尽可能保持笑容……我能做到的，大概也就这些了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
